<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay int'l reserves fall 1.0 pct to $1.01 bln.</title>
<headline>Paraguay int'l reserves fall 1.0 pct to $1.01 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's international reserves fell 1.0 percent to $1.005 billion on October 18 from $1.015 billion on September 30, the central bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>No explanation was given for the decline.</p>
<p>-- Asuncion newsroom, 595 21 444527</p>
</text>
